seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: the harness approved, then a person keyed the same box: the person's
# input is the box's latest, so the close is theirs, `passed`.
see busy
half
see prompt edit
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=edit at=500
admit harness act=approve
accept
at 600 person
at 700 see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=human at=700
